  "description": "🌜Valiant - Learn Build Conquer🌛\n\n✨A Guild built for the Idle-MMO community, to bring new and old players together.\n\n✨Established March of 2025\n\n✨Originator of the LBC Alliance\n\n✨Discord - https://discord.gg/VbxyKAetzZ\n\n🌟🌟🌟🌟🌟🌟🌟🌟🌟🌟🌟🌟🌟🌟🌟🌟🌟🌟\n\n💠Join Requirements💠\n\n✅Active Daily.\n\n✅Full Participation in Guild Raids.\n\n✅Contribution to the Guild Challenges.\n\n✅Combat Level isn&#039;t required yet, however make sure to keep raising it as we will add one soon.\n\n✅Must join the Guild Discord.\n\n🌟🌟🌟🌟🌟🌟🌟🌟🌟🌟🌟🌟🌟🌟🌟🌟🌟🌟\n\nRaid Times\nAt the moment there is no schedule to raid times. \n\n🌟🌟🌟🌟🌟🌟🌟🌟🌟🌟🌟🌟🌟🌟🌟🌟🌟🌟\n\nApply Today! Interested in joining our Guild or Alliance? Apply today on our discord link above! \nIn-game only applications will not be acceptable.",
